@startuml overview-state-machine
!include style.iuml
' The incident lifecycle at report size: nine statuses, ten legal moves, who makes each.
' The full diagram, with what happens on each move, is state-machine.puml.

hide empty description
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam stateFontSize 13
skinparam stateFontName Geist SemiBold
skinparam stateFontColor #0A0A0A

[*] --> NEW : report
NEW --> CLASSIFIED : system: priority, SLA
CLASSIFIED --> ASSIGNED : system or admin: assign
ASSIGNED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : technician: acknowledge
ACKNOWLEDGED --> IN_PROGRESS : technician: start
IN_PROGRESS --> AWAITING_INFO : technician:\nrequest info
AWAITING_INFO --> IN_PROGRESS : employee: reply\ntechnician: resume
IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : technician:\nresolve
RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : employee or admin:\nreopen
RESOLVED --> VERIFIED : employee: confirm
VERIFIED --> CLOSED : technician or admin: close
CLOSED --> [*]

NEW : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>NewState</size></color></font>
CLASSIFIED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>ClassifiedState</size></color></font>
ASSIGNED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>AssignedState</size></color></font>
ACKNOWLEDGED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>AcknowledgedState</size></color></font>
IN_PROGRESS : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>InProgressState</size></color></font>
AWAITING_INFO : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>AwaitingInfoState</size></color></font>
AWAITING_INFO : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>SLA clock paused</size></color></font>
RESOLVED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>ResolvedState</size></color></font>
VERIFIED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>VerifiedState</size></color></font>
CLOSED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>ClosedState</size></color></font>
CLOSED : <font:Geist><color:#737373><size:11>final</size></color></font>
@enduml
